  "idea": "How to turn paper documents into search-ready PDFs using your phone",
  "text": "This simple paperless workflow keeps your entire desk organized without physical clutter. Stacking incoming bills and medical forms on your desk creates clutter and missed payment deadlines. Saving raw phone photos mixes legal paperwork with family pictures, burying critical files when needed. Instead, scan incoming pages directly into Apple Notes with auto-detection and searchable OCR enabled. You maintain a clean desk and searchable digital filing cabinet.",
